# reports.func

> Module: reports (Raporlama) | Category: ANALYTICS

## Purpose
Comprehensive reporting module for Turkish trucking companies. Aggregates data from all modules to produce actionable business reports: revenue vs expenses by month, profit-per-truck analysis, driver performance metrics, and seasonal trend analysis. Goes beyond competitors by integrating prediction data and cross-module correlations.

## Problems It Solves
- Turkish fleet owners make decisions by gut feel, not data
- No competitor shows **profit-per-truck** or **profit-per-driver** (only total revenue)
- Seasonal variations (Ramazan, Kurban Bayramı, harvest season) not accounted for by competitors
- Tax preparation requires categorized expense reports (21 categories → grouped by tax type)
- Export to Excel with Turkish formatting (₺ symbol, comma decimals)

## Competitor Shortcomings We Fix
| Competitor | Shortcoming | Our Fix |
|-----------|------------|---------|
| FiloMetrik | Only dashboard KPIs, no downloadable reports | Full CSV/Excel/PDF export |
| ARYOSIS | Excel-based, no web integration | Real-time web reports with live data |
| Loggerise | Generic business reports | Turkish-logistics-specific: per-plate, per-sefer, seasonal |
| IDLOG | No prediction integration | Combines actual + predicted data in same report |
| All | No profit-per-driver analysis | Revenue/trip × driver with expense allocation |

## Technical Database Structure
**No new tables needed** — pure read aggregation from existing tables:
- `trips` (revenue, completion status, driver, truck, dates)
- `expenses` (categories, amounts, dates, truck)
- `invoices` (revenue, status, customer)
- `fuel_logs` (liters, cost, truck, km)
- `maintenance_records` (cost, truck, type)
- `predictions` (forecast data)
- `employees` (driver info)

## User Interface
**ReportsPage.tsx** — `/dashboard/reports`
- Tab navigation: Gelir/Gider | Kâr Analizi | Araç Bazlı | Şoför Performans
- Date range selector
- Charts (recharts): stacked bar, line, pie
- Summary KPI cards at top
- Export buttons (CSV, Excel, PDF)
- Print-friendly layout

## API Endpoints
| Method | Path | Description |
|--------|------|-------------|
| GET | `/api/tenant/reports/revenue-expenses?start=&end=` | Monthly revenue vs expenses |
| GET | `/api/tenant/reports/profit-per-truck?start=&end=` | Profit by vehicle |
| GET | `/api/tenant/reports/profit-per-driver?start=&end=` | Profit by driver |
| GET | `/api/tenant/reports/category-breakdown?start=&end=` | Expense category pie |
| GET | `/api/tenant/reports/summary?start=&end=` | Overall KPI summary |
